OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged after woman, 38,
OL,4,Asexually assaulted in Arbroath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been charged after a
OL,7,F38-year-old woman was sexually
OL,8,Fassaulted in Arbroath.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the incident on
OL,11,FArbirlot Road, near Monymusk Road, at
OL,12,Fabout 06:10 on Monday.
OL,14,FThe 18-year-old man is due to appear
OL,15,Fbefore Forfar Sheriff Court on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FDet Insp Nikki Venters said: "I would
OL,19,Flike to thank the public for their
OL,20,Fassistance with this investigation."
